#: ../../source/index.rst:5 e763fc00ebdf4a09880f9a18784af580
msgid "_`Introduction`"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/index.rst:7 a5394c657a79418da41faab3859b132c
msgid ""
"food_volume_measure is a C++17 library for point-cloud food volume "
"measurement on oven trays. It implements the IM (baseline-plane height-"
"difference integral) method: an empty-oven baseline is discretized into a"
" local-plane height map, the food cloud is voxel-downsampled and "
"clustered in the baseline plane, and per-cell height differences are "
"integrated into a volume in cubic centimeters."
msgstr ""
"food_volume_measure 是一个用于烤盘食材体积测量的 C++17 点云库。它实现了 "
"IM（基准面高度差积分）方法：先将空炉基线离散为局部平面上的高度图，再对食物点云进行体素降采样并在基准面内聚类，最后将逐格高度差积分得到以立方厘米为单位的体积。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:14 93882504e96c46ca9ed31c747f17c159
msgid "_`Algorithm Steps`"
msgstr "算法步骤"

#: ../../source/index.rst:16 6562407d2bd544dca7000141f39094e8
msgid ""
"Measurement runs through six stages. The figures below show the rendered "
"output of each stage for a real oven-tray scan."
msgstr "整个测量流程分为六个阶段，下图展示了对一次真实烤盘扫描在各阶段的渲染输出。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:22 6183263e87a346bc947055b10f1522b9
msgid "原始输入点云"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:22 ed7b9080e2414bee865da516147b1501
msgid ""
"**Step 1 - Raw input cloud.** The food frame as captured by the tray-"
"mounted depth camera; non-finite returns are dropped and coordinates are "
"converted to metres."
msgstr "**步骤 1 - 原始输入点云。** 由烤盘上方深度相机采集的食材帧；非有限返回值被剔除，坐标统一换算为米。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:28 bc4a0c372ac34487b684351b408addc9
msgid "体素降采样后的点云"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:28 44308380a89046d0a849beb9f2b651e7
msgid ""
"**Step 2 - Voxel downsampling.** Every occupied voxel keeps the centroid "
"of its points, which suppresses sensor noise and removes the dependency "
"on the raw point density."
msgstr "**步骤 2 - 体素降采样。** 每个被占据的体素保留其点云质心，用于抑制传感器噪声，并使后续阶段不再依赖原始点密度。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:34 db02e318c49d49f2a02967f5e95a5ce0
msgid "空炉基准面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:34 02e39a09aaf84ac080deac390696db4e
msgid ""
"**Step 3 - Empty-oven baseline.** A RANSAC plane fit plus per-cell median"
" heights turn the empty tray into the reference surface against which "
"food heights are measured."
msgstr "**步骤 3 - 空炉基线。** 通过 RANSAC 平面拟合与逐格中值高度，把空烤盘构建成用于测量食材高度的参考曲面。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:40 7ad6908f0cc94705a1fd59dd88a6ca84
msgid "去除背景平面后的点云"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:40 a8188b88e2ab4d8c9c68f945e5d1b528
msgid ""
"**Step 4 - Background-plane removal.** The dominant tray plane is removed"
" from the food frame, so that chiefly food points remain."
msgstr "**步骤 4 - 背景平面去除。** 从食材帧中移除占主导的烤盘平面，使剩余点主要是食材本身。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:46 e95dd0b920bb45849976a68e66a78b01
msgid "分割出的食材组件"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:46 3488dd629f13444b9a93bafa2c35628b
msgid ""
"**Step 5 - Component segmentation.** The remaining points are projected "
"onto the baseline plane and clustered with DBSCAN, which separates "
"distinct food items into individual components."
msgstr "**步骤 5 - 组件分割。** 将剩余点投影到基准面上并用 DBSCAN 聚类，从而把不同食材分割为独立组件。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:52 2c789b39eeb94512a12275b025986936
msgid "用于高度积分的顶面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:52 67c0341279ac452eae7649d0d6ec3490
msgid ""
"**Step 6 - Height integral.** One top-surface point per raster cell is "
"kept and its baseline-relative height is integrated over the cell area; "
"enclosed holes are completed conservatively."
msgstr "**步骤 6 - 高度积分。** 每个栅格保留一个顶面点，将其相对基准面的高度沿栅格面积积分得到体积；封闭空洞以保守方式补全。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:55 aa731a58e5304f0eaf0e8d451832df15
msgid "_`Main Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/index.rst:57 437acde100c34eb1b3689cf8151a0a86
msgid "Empty-oven baseline model with RANSAC plane fitting"
msgstr "基于 RANSAC 平面拟合的空炉基线模型"

#: ../../source/index.rst:58 fa54341681e145a3848153dfd65f8ab2
msgid "Open3D-equivalent voxel downsampling and DBSCAN clustering"
msgstr "与 Open3D 等价的体素降采样与 DBSCAN 聚类"

#: ../../source/index.rst:59 4df1db0428454611b9ec6577e07daaca
msgid "Component-aware conservative hole completion"
msgstr "组件感知的保守补洞"

#: ../../source/index.rst:60 eb2ca79687fe414c9cea21b7a41231ed
msgid "Reference volumes (AABB / OBB / convex hull)"
msgstr "参考体积（AABB / OBB / 凸包）"

#: ../../source/index.rst:61 54e4d0db83254256a4cb76d86dd70707
msgid "PCD loading via ``load_pcd``"
msgstr "通过 ``load_pcd`` 载入 PCD"

#: ../../source/index.rst:62 1974f908e7064ac9a2eb3d36b7438cd1
msgid ""
"Host-side point-cloud processing; bare-metal stubs report an unsupported "
"status"
msgstr "仅宿主机侧点云处理；裸机桩返回不支持状态"

